# Engineer-in-\<role\>

When `product-lead` assigns execution work:

1. Wave roles `dev`/`test`/`devops` share one **branch** + Work Contract — spawn in parallel
2. `design` before wave if needed; `review` only after **snap** (include
   `secret-safe-review.mdc` scan)
3. Playbook: `.agents/skills/engineer-in/SKILL.md` + `docs/agents/parallel-wave.md`
4. No delivery PR mid-wave

Product-lead owns plan/contract/snap; engineers execute in `checkouts/`.
